|Type Hints|

def calculate_balance(balance: float, withdrawal: float) -> float:
    return balance - withdrawal

Type hints don't force Python to behave like a statically typed language, but they improve readability, tooling, and maintainability.
You'll use these heavily when we learn FastAPI.


def clean_text(text: str) -> str:
    """
    Remove leading/trailing whitespace
    and convert text to lowercase.
    """
    return text.strip().lower()

